  "@type": "Process",
  "critical": false,
  "description": "Monitoring and mitigation of microgravity physiological effects: bone mineral density loss at 1-2% per month at load-bearing skeletal sites, cephalad fluid shift causing Spaceflight-Associated Neuro-ocular Syndrome (SANS), muscle atrophy at 0.5-1% per day without countermeasures, and cardiovascular deconditioning with orthostatic intolerance on return to 1g.",
